        "TileImage": "$($repository a55a056b-e5e5-452c-aa75-c5edfc1b73f5).Image",
        "Description": "There is a small terrorist cell gathering resources in Marrakesh, Morroco. They are not much of a threat currently, but a small infection left untreated can become a great sickness.\r\rFirst of three is Gerges, a popular rug salesman. His connections cover up many of the terrorist mistakes, and his status leads no suspicion towards himself.  Eliminate the leader, Mukarram Javid cleanly and his right hand man Cmdr. Reza, else he can replace Javid. You must not let them time to escape.",
